    "workout_plan": "Strength FocusSquats & Romanian Deadlifts: 4 sets of 5 reps to build a solid power foundation.Superset (Push/Pull): Incline Dumbbell Press & Wide-Grip Pull-Ups (4 sets of 5–8 reps).Conditioning: Finish with 8 sprint intervals (all-out effort) with 1-minute rest between.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHypertrophy & enduranceOverhead Press & Rear Delt Pulls: 4 sets of 10–15 reps to build muscle volume.Single-Leg Work: Bulgarian Split Squats (4 sets of 10 per leg).Conditioning: Sled pulls, drags, or Farmer's walks for 3 lengths to build functional stamina.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPower & ExplosivenessClean and Press: 3 sets of 5–8 reps focusing on moving the weight quickly.Plyometrics: Box jumps or jump squats (4 sets of 10) to improve force development.Conditioning: Another round of sprint intervals or agility drills.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nStrength FocusSquats & Romanian Deadlifts: 4 sets of 5 reps to build a solid power foundation.Superset (Push/Pull): Incline Dumbbell Press & Wide-Grip Pull-Ups (4 sets of 5–8 reps).Conditioning: Finish with 8 sprint intervals (all-out effort) with 1-minute rest between.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nStrength FocusSquats & Romanian Deadlifts: 4 sets of 5 reps to build a solid power foundation.Superset (Push/Pull): Incline Dumbbell Press & Wide-Grip Pull-Ups (4 sets of 5–8 reps).Conditioning: Finish with 8 sprint intervals (all-out effort) with 1-minute rest between.",
