    "nutrition_plan": "Strategic Meal TimingTiming your nutrients around your \"training window\" can significantly impact performance and recovery.Pre-Workout (1–3 hours before): Focus on complex carbs and moderate protein to sustain energy.Example: Oatmeal with a banana or Greek yogurt with berries.Intra-Workout (During): For sessions over 60–90 minutes, sip a sports drink or consume 30–60g of fast-acting carbs.Post-Workout (Within 1–2 hours): Combine high-quality protein (20–40g) with fast-digesting carbs to jumpstart muscle repair and glycogen replenishment.Example: Whey protein shake with a banana or chicken with white rice.",
